# gitignore matches whole path segments, so the two rules above do NOT cover
# these (differently named) simulation output folders - list them explicitly
# Large regenerable model output. The .nosync suffix keeps iCloud Drive from
# syncing these (~16 GB); the un-suffixed name is a symlink pointing at it, so
# every path in the code is unchanged. No trailing slash, so both match.
**/particle_filtering_model_runs
**/particle_filtering_model_runs.nosync
**/paper_uqef_dynamic_sim
**/paper_uqef_dynamic_sim.nosync
saves/
__pycache__/
.idea/
saves/figures/
sg_anaysis/
log*


